2,"speakerName":"ペチーナ","textMapHash":1185084522,"text":"えっと…ずっとここで二人を観察してたんだけど…","nextNodeIds":[760470102]},{"nodeId":760470102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2306933266,"text":"まさか監視員かなにか？","nextNodeIds":[760470103]},{"nodeId":760470103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7042,"speakerName":"ペチーナ","textMapHash":2715346354,"text":"違う違う。ここにはよく本を探しに来るんだけど、投資に興味を持ってそうな二人をたまたま見かけたから…ここの投資は胡散臭いから、やめといたほうがいいよ。","nextNodeIds":[760470104]},{"nodeId":760470104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":932552930,"text":"確かにオイラたち、まだ大きな見返りはもらってないけど…「胡散臭い」ってどういうことだ？","nextNodeIds":[760470105]},{"nodeId":760470105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7042,"speakerName":"ペチーナ","textMapHash":2099745666,"text":"大儲けできるわけないと思うんだよね。あの人、まだかなりの借金があるから、損する商売はしないはずだよ。","nextNodeIds":[760470106]},{"nodeId":760470106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7042,"speakerName":"ペチーナ","textMapHash":1640833882,"text":"私の友達も同じような詐欺に遭ったことがあるから、二人も買うのはもうやめたほうがいいと思う。","nextNodeIds":[760470107]},{"nodeId":760470107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3758139218,"text":"#本当に詐欺なのか…？{NICKNAME}、あいつをしっかり問いただそうぜ！","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7604701,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["7042"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}},{"subQuestId":7604702,"order":2,"stepDescription":"サビトと会話する","stepDescTextMapHash":1907132404,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL"